  "instance_name": "angry_cat_visual_metaphor",
  "label": "Angry Cat Visual Metaphor",
  "description": "A visual trope where an expressive, often anthropomorphized animal (in this case, a cat) is used to represent human emotions or behaviors — particularly anger, frustration, or aggression. The cat's posture (standing on hind legs, paws raised, mouth open) is exaggerated to mimic human shouting or yelling, serving as a humorous or mocking visual stand-in for a human character. This metaphor is central to the meme’s humor and intent.",
